g bounty model","reason":"Curly scare quotes on a normal term are banned."},{"original":"United Nations’ Group","replacement":"United Nations' Group","reason":"Curly apostrophe replaced with a straight one."},{"original":"European Union’s Cybersecurity Act","replacement":"European Union's Cybersecurity Act","reason":"Curly apostrophe replaced with a straight one."},{"original":"robust encryption (AES","replacement":"strong encryption (AES","reason":"'robust' is a discouraged word."},{"original":"which streamlines containment. The playbook change significantly reduces mean time to contain.","replacement":"which speeds up containment. The playbook change cut mean time to contain.","reason":"'streamlines' and 'significantly' are discouraged words."},{"original":"leveraging machine‑learning models","replacement":"using machine‑learning models","reason":"'leveraging' is a discouraged word."},{"original":"Leverage federated learning","replacement":"Use federated learning","reason":"'Leverage' is a discouraged word."},{"original":"can foster complacency","replacement":"can breed complacency","reason":"'foster' is a discouraged word."},{"original":"fostering a collaborative security ecosystem","replacement":"building a collaborative security community","reason":"'fostering' and metaphorical 'ecosystem' are discouraged."},{"original":"dramatically broader","replacement":"far broader","reason":"'dramatically' is a discouraged intensifier."},{"original":"Moreover, the rise of deep","replacement":"The rise of deep","reason":"'Moreover' is a discouraged transition."},{"original":"Moreover, strict role","replacement":"Strict role","reason":"'Moreover' is a discouraged transition."},{"original":"will be pivotal for maintaining","replacement":"will matter for maintaining","reason":"'pivotal' is a discouraged word."},{"original":"extraordinary benefits","replacement":"large benefits","reason":"'extraordinary' is an inflated intensifier of the same kind as the banned list."},{"origin